                <h2>🎉 v1.5.62 Update</h2>
<ul>
    <li>✨ <b>Create Actions with AI</b><br>
        - Describe the action you want, refine it through conversation, test it, and save it directly to OnText.
    </li>
    <li>💬 <b>Continue Previous Work</b><br>
        - Reopen earlier action conversations and update installed actions without starting over.
    </li>
    <li>🛠 <b>Smoother and More Reliable</b><br>
        - Improved editing, scrolling, icon and emoji selection, and app icon sizing.
    </li>
</ul>
